Does this person have two phones?

546
00:46:23,657 --> 00:46:27,606
I'll keep trying to contact composer
Yoon Seo Il over the weekend.

547
00:46:35,103 --> 00:46:37,028
Leave early today.

548
00:46:37,592 --> 00:46:40,507
You'll have to come in tomorrow, too.

549
00:46:40,507 --> 00:46:42,468
Tomorrow? No way.

550
00:46:42,468 --> 00:46:44,302
I have a gig.

551
00:46:44,302 --> 00:46:48,932
Can't I take a break this weekend?

552
00:46:48,932 --> 00:46:51,309
We went on a business trip last week.

553
00:46:51,309 --> 00:46:56,762
I need to rest to be efficient at work,
so just know that.

554
00:47:00,861 --> 00:47:03,458
You're a pro at making me speechless.

555
00:47:04,530 --> 00:47:05,908
How about a meal together?

556
00:47:05,908 --> 00:47:07,034
What?

557
00:47:07,034 --> 00:47:08,497
Out of the blue?

558
00:47:12,539 --> 00:47:14,270
What's gotten into you?

559
00:47:17,123 --> 00:47:19,546
Don't act like a gentleman.

560
00:47:19,546 --> 00:47:21,137
I won't be fooled.

561
00:47:22,716 --> 00:47:24,927
I've always been a gentleman.

562
00:47:24,927 --> 00:47:26,553
Sure, okay.

563
00:47:26,553 --> 00:47:28,981
A black-hearted gentleman.

564
00:47:35,896 --> 00:47:38,643
Why are you just standing there?

565
00:47:38,643 --> 00:47:41,735
I was thinking you haven't changed much
since day one.

566
00:47:41,735 --> 00:47:43,153
Of course not.

567
00:47:43,153 --> 00:47:47,278
I was honest then, and I'm honest now.

568
00:48:04,508 --> 00:48:05,676
I see.

569
00:48:06,695 --> 00:48:09,301
Then I'll be honest too.

570
00:48:11,526 --> 00:48:13,778
If you say you don't like me,

571
00:48:15,396 --> 00:48:17,482
I'll have to get engaged this winter.

572
00:48:23,694 --> 00:48:25,153
You're lying, right?

573
00:48:25,153 --> 00:48:27,906
Ugh, engage my foot.

574
00:48:27,906 --> 00:48:32,217
You're just making things up
to win this argument, aren't you?

575
00:48:32,217 --> 00:48:35,622
I don't use the word "honest" when I'm lying.

576
00:48:35,622 --> 00:48:36,873
It looks pathetic.

577
00:48:36,873 --> 00:48:37,916
Then...

578
00:48:39,251 --> 00:48:42,004
you're really getting engaged?

579
00:48:42,004 --> 00:48:43,965
My father picked her out.

580
00:48:45,340 --> 00:48:47,156
She's arriving in Korea soon.

581
00:48:47,156 --> 00:48:49,651
He picked her out?

582
00:48:49,651 --> 00:48:53,015
And who is this woman coming
to Korea just to get engaged?

583
00:48:53,015 --> 00:48:57,208
I guess it bothers you
that I'm getting engaged.

584
00:49:28,842 --> 00:49:33,221
I don't think I've said
anything to deserve this.

585
00:49:33,221 --> 00:49:34,890
You said you're getting engaged.

586
00:49:34,890 --> 00:49:37,142
It's not like I'm dumping you to get engaged.

587
00:49:37,142 --> 00:49:39,309
Were we even dating?

588
00:49:41,688 --> 00:49:43,315
Right now,

589
00:49:43,857 --> 00:49:47,790
I feel like I'm being completely played by you.

590
00:49:47,790 --> 00:49:49,990
Why are you telling me this?

591
00:49:49,990 --> 00:49:52,324
If you're getting engaged in winter,

592
00:49:52,324 --> 00:49:55,619
it has nothing to do with me
until our contract ends, right?

593
00:49:55,619 --> 00:49:58,887
I need you to get out of this engagement.

594
00:50:00,499 --> 00:50:01,941
Are you...

595
00:50:03,669 --> 00:50:05,736
playing with me on purpose?

596
00:50:05,736 --> 00:50:09,145
I've never been this honest in my life.

597
00:50:09,145 --> 00:50:10,884
I told you

598
00:50:10,884 --> 00:50:13,394
you've somehow become my girlfriend.

599
00:50:14,888 --> 00:50:17,391
I need to prove that to my father.

600
00:50:17,391 --> 00:50:21,309
Now you want me to be your fake girlfriend too?

601
00:50:21,937 --> 00:50:24,564
Didn't you say you'd repay me when I needed it?

602
00:50:24,564 --> 00:50:26,274
Shut up!

603
00:50:44,710 --> 00:50:46,801
The woman must be...

604
00:50:47,877 --> 00:50:49,923
from a rich family too.

605
00:50:54,845 --> 00:50:58,996
They'll marry their own kind
and live happily ever after.

606
00:51:04,631 --> 00:51:07,207
Should I have just said yes?

607
00:51:08,120 --> 00:51:10,184
If I say no,

608
00:51:11,014 --> 00:51:13,410
he'll just take someone else, right?

609
00:51:17,534 --> 00:51:19,527
He even has a fiancée.

610
00:51:20,287 --> 00:51:22,449
Why did he show up in front of me?

611
00:51:24,249 --> 00:51:27,043
He shouldn't have appeared in the first place.

612
00:51:36,052 --> 00:51:37,941
Can't sleep again, boss?

613
00:51:47,314 --> 00:51:49,941
But lately,
the only time you hit REM sleep was...

614
00:51:49,941 --> 00:51:51,394
Stop!

615
00:51:55,655 --> 00:51:58,613
I'll be there today
for an appointment, so clear your schedule.

616
00:52:12,088 --> 00:52:14,277
She's not picking up, huh?

617
00:52:15,967 --> 00:52:17,177
This is bad.

618
00:52:17,177 --> 00:52:19,221
You shouldn't rely on pills.

619
00:52:19,221 --> 00:52:23,016
You shouldn't rely on pills
too much to hide it.

620
00:52:23,016 --> 00:52:25,804
Gosh, you're such a nag.

621
00:52:30,347 --> 00:52:32,442
Do Hyeok, you're here.

622
00:52:32,442 --> 00:52:34,569
I heard you were back in Korea.

623
00:52:34,569 --> 00:52:37,194
Eun Seo, long time no see. How have you been?

624
00:52:38,188 --> 00:52:40,534
It's been way too long.

625
00:52:40,534 --> 00:52:43,328
He was in the area and just stopped by.

626
00:52:43,328 --> 00:52:45,997
Should the three of us grab a meal?

627
00:52:45,997 --> 00:52:48,250
Next time. I have some work to do.

628
00:52:48,250 --> 00:52:50,377
Really? That's a shame.

629
00:52:50,377 --> 00:52:52,045
In that case,

630
00:52:52,045 --> 00:52:53,871
let's call Tae Gyeong over.

631
00:52:53,871 --> 00:52:55,006
Did you know?

632
00:52:55,006 --> 00:52:59,511
I think Tae Gyeong likes Lee Eun Chae.

633
00:52:59,511 --> 00:53:00,971
Really?

634
00:53:00,971 --> 00:53:02,764
He should be at the hospital now.

635
00:53:02,764 --> 00:53:03,974
Let's call him.

636
00:53:04,558 --> 00:53:05,934
I'm leaving.

637
00:53:05,934 --> 00:53:07,018
See you, Eun Seo.

638
00:53:07,018 --> 00:53:09,312
Okay, see you next time.

639
00:53:09,312 --> 00:53:10,312
Bye.

640
00:53:21,035 --> 00:53:24,375
[Concert for Little Stars]

641
00:53:30,287 --> 00:53:33,081
[Charity Event for Children with Cancer]

642
00:54:06,828 --> 00:54:08,997
It's so pretty.

643
00:54:08,997 --> 00:54:10,498
You did a great job.

644
00:54:10,498 --> 00:54:12,584
Thank you so much.

645
00:54:14,614 --> 00:54:16,761
[Lee Eun Chae]

646
00:54:21,092 --> 00:54:22,296
[Psychopath]

647
00:54:25,180 --> 00:54:26,848
The kids really loved it.

648
00:54:26,848 --> 00:54:29,351
I know. They're so cute.

649
00:54:29,351 --> 00:54:30,727
Right?

650
00:54:30,727 --> 00:54:31,969
You were the best.

651
00:54:44,282 --> 00:54:47,171
Wait a minute. What are you doing?

652
00:54:50,956 --> 00:54:52,582
Because this is important to me.

653
00:54:52,582 --> 00:54:54,584
Performing is what matters most to me.

654
00:54:54,584 --> 00:54:56,086
Yeah, that performance.

655
00:54:56,086 --> 00:54:57,712
Why didn't you mention it?

656
00:54:57,712 --> 00:55:00,343
Do I have to report every show to you?

657
00:55:01,091 --> 00:55:02,550
Why didn't you pick up?

658
00:55:02,550 --> 00:55:03,802
Because I didn't want to.

659
00:55:03,802 --> 00:55:05,512
And also...

660
00:55:05,512 --> 00:55:07,037
Who's the bouquet guy?

661
00:55:07,037 --> 00:55:09,933
Do you just smile at any random guy?

662
00:55:09,933 --> 00:55:11,468
What's it to you?

663
00:55:12,769 --> 00:55:14,523
We have a bet going.

664
00:55:15,855 --> 00:55:18,149
Is the bet all you care about?

665
00:55:18,149 --> 00:55:21,194
Then that bet, let's just call it off.

666
00:55:21,194 --> 00:55:24,364
It's weird for someone getting engaged
to be making bets anyway.

667
00:55:24,364 --> 00:55:26,067
Exactly.

668
00:55:26,741 --> 00:55:28,994
Just pretend to be my fiancée.

669
00:55:28,994 --> 00:55:31,496
My life depends on your answer.

670
00:55:31,496 --> 00:55:32,810
Your life?

671
00:55:36,126 --> 00:55:39,488
Then your life's already a lost cause.

672
00:55:39,488 --> 00:55:41,505
I thought you...

673
00:55:53,351 --> 00:55:54,978
It's my sister!

674
00:55:56,479 --> 00:55:57,974
Hurry up.

675
00:56:25,425 --> 00:56:26,841
Eun Chae.

676
00:56:59,414 --> 00:57:03,379
You're the first woman whose feelings
for me I've ever wondered about.

677
00:57:03,379 --> 00:57:04,714
Hey! Don't take it off!

678
00:57:04,714 --> 00:57:05,719
Lee Eun Chae!

679
00:57:05,719 --> 00:57:09,052
I should show him
that the entertainment industry isn't easy.

680
00:57:09,052 --> 00:57:10,262
It's a terror attack!

681
00:57:10,262 --> 00:57:12,514
If you want to debut, I could ask my mom.

682
00:57:12,514 --> 00:57:16,017
You want me to ruin my life
just to ruin your engagement?

683
00:57:16,017 --> 00:57:17,185
Is it kiss time?

684
00:57:17,185 --> 00:57:19,687
Don't do this to just any woman.

685
00:57:19,687 --> 00:57:21,231
I found a replacement for you.

686
00:57:21,231 --> 00:57:22,565
I'll terminate the contract.

687
00:57:22,565 --> 00:57:23,566
You bastard...

688
00:57:23,566 --> 00:57:26,453
Do you really not care
if I get engaged to another woman?
